@baseUrl = http://localhost:64663

### Add or update a year's historical free cash flow
POST {{baseUrl}}/valuation/NASDAQ/MSFT/free-cash-flow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2024,
  "value": 72800
}

### Read DCF valuation using historical free-cash-flow growth
GET {{baseUrl}}/valuation/dcf/en/NASDAQ/MSFT
